 I need to clear my head and clarify my goals, even though I likely won't touch this again until next weekend (which saddens me a bit):

  Prove you can bring up a node with a dialogue and a song.
  Prove you can traverse to another node with a menu.
  Prove you can select from that menu.
  Prove that the action from selecting the item has its effect.
  Prove that actions can iterate over a collection.
  Prove that you can do a sequence of events.
  Prove that you can do a sequence of menus acting on a specified map.
  
